gxr-key-remap (1.0.0+gxr2~26.10.1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Recognize the mainline ABOV A96T396 Touch Slider alongside the vendor
    sec_touchkey device, preserving touch-to-left-button remapping.
  * Accept both gpio_keys (vendor 5.10) and gpio-keys (7.4) input device
    names, and count each button source only once during discovery.
  * Move publishing scripts under packaging/, use an image per Ubuntu
    series, and add arm64 test builds from the generated source packages.

